OL,3,GNEWSA'I won't let life-changing crash
OL,4,Adefine me,' says 20-year-old
OL,5,
OL,6,FKay-Shaw said that despite many
OL,7,Fchallenges he has faced since the
OL,8,Fcrash, he had become much more
OL,9,F"outgoing".
